<title>USA: Rich Twp. HSD 227, Ill., $14.08 mln won by Griffin.</title>
<headline>Rich Twp. HSD 227, Ill., $14.08 mln won by Griffin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $14.080 million of Rich Twp. HSD 227, Ill., general obligation life safety refunding bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.232 percent.</p>
</text>
